      "blocks": {
        "heading_tkA7gp": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>OWN THE ROAD: Give Your Car The Aggressive, One-of-a-Kind Presence It Deserves  (Without The Risky \"Back-Street\" Fitment)</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_TGpqBp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Listen… you didn’t spend all this money on your car just to watch three identical ones pull up next to you at the traffic lights.</h2><p>You know the feeling. You love the car, but it looks… <strong>\"Basic\".</strong> It’s invisible. It lacks that aggressive, <strong>\"Neck-Snapping\"</strong> presence that separates it from all the others.<br/><br/>You’ve thought about a bodykit. You’ve seen the carbon splitters and the aggressive diffusers online. But you’re terrified of <strong>\"The Gap.\"</strong></p><p>You know exactly what that means - panels that don't line up. Tape that peels off after two car washes. Parts that look like they were \"slapped on\" rather than <strong>integrated.</strong></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_tkA7gp",
        "text_TGpqBp"
