          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li><strong>The \"No-Gap\" Integration:</strong> Most shops work to a timer. We work to the millimetre. If the alignment isn't factory-flush, the car doesn't leave the workshop.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Resale Value: </strong>Most \"fitters\" drill random holes and use permanent, messy adhesives that ruin your original bodywork. We use a <strong>\"Preservation-First\" </strong>approach - using factory mounting points so your car keeps its value and can be returned to stock if you ever decide to sell. In many cases you can sell your car faster and for more money thanks to the bodykit.</li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Structural Integrity:</strong> We don't rely on <strong>\"hope and prayer\"</strong> adhesives. We use automotive-grade bonding and mechanical fixings that are built to withstand high-speed motorway runs.</li></ul><p></p>"
          }
        }
      },
