          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Get It Done Right. The First Time.</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_K9iwbn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We are a low-volume, high-quality workshop in Charlwood. We deliberately limit our bookings so that we can obsess over every single screw and panel gap on your car. <strong>Elite attention isn’t scalable.</strong></p><p>If you’re done settling for \"pretty good\" and you want the aggressive, no-compromise finish your car deserves…</p><p><strong>Stop scrolling.</strong></p><p><strong>WHATSAPP US A PHOTO OF YOUR CAR AND THE LOOK YOU WANT. <br/>We’ll give you a \"Fitment Audit\" and a transparent quote within 2 hours.<br/><br/></strong>Our Charlwood workshop is always booking up fast. Secure your slot now to ensure your car gets the \"Neck-Snapping\" bodykit installation it deserves.</p><p>Or call <strong>07548 703902</strong> right now. Don't let another \"half-baked\" fitter ruin your car.</p>"
          }
        }
